Package: Rclean
Title: Reproducible Quality Control and Cleaning for Survey Data (xlsx/csv)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Renzhi",
           family = "Yang",
           email = "your.email@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Eight-step data quality control workflow for questionnaire /
    epidemiological survey data stored as xlsx or csv: (1) duplicate cases,
    (2) illegal values, (3) cross-variable logical checks, (4) missing
    values, (5) outliers of continuous variables, (6) consolidated anomaly
    report, (7) change log of every cleaning action, (8) export of the clean
    dataset. Questionnaire-specific rules (ranges, legal values, logical
    expressions) are kept outside the code in Excel or YAML rule tables.
